cess","checkedAt":"2026-10-15T10:42:24.486Z","error":null}},"steamMetadata":{"appId":"1745510","links":{"store":"https://store.steampowered.com/app/1745510/","officialWebsite":"https://www.kira-llc.com/","support":null},"storageRequirements":{"kind":"required_free_space","windows":{"minimum":{"value":800,"unit":"MB","display":"800 MB","approximateBytes":800000000,"evidenceText":"Storage: 800 MB"},"recommended":null},"macos":{"minimum":null,"recommended":null},"linux":{"minimum":null,"recommended":null},"note":"Steam publishes required free space, not the exact installed or download size."},"controllerSupport":{"level":"full","xboxCompatible":null,"xboxEvidence":null,"note":"Generic Steam controller support does not prove Xbox controller compatibility."},"playerModes":{"singlePlayer":true,"multiplayer":false,"coop":false,"onlineCoop":false,"localCoop":false,"lanCoop":false,"sharedOrSplitScreen":false,"pvp":false,"maximumPlayers":null,"maximumPlayersNote":"The public Steam app-details response does not provide a reliable exact player limit.","evidence":["Single-player"]},"genres":["Indie","RPG"],"categories":[{"id":2,"description":"Single-player"},{"id":22,"description":"Steam Achievements"},{"id":28,"description":"Full controller support"},{"id":29,"description":"Steam Trading Cards"},{"id":25,"description":"Steam Leaderboards"},{"id":62,"description":"Family Sharing"}]}},"content":{"status":"success","steamAppId":"1745510","steamName":"Lunacid","sourceUrl":"https://store.steampowered.com/app/1745510/","fetchedAt":"2026-10-16T08:15:14.375090+00:00","locales":{"en":{"status":"source","provider":"steam","shortDescription":"Cast into the Great Well, unwanted by the world above. You delve the dark in search of the Old One, your last salvation. Lunacid is a dark fantasy dungeon crawler inspired by Shadow Tower and King’s Field.","detailedDescription":"From the creator of Lost in Vivo and Spooky’s Jump Scare Mansion, Lunacid is a horror ARPG from a bygone era. Immerse yourself in a dark, desperate world full of foes, lost souls, and hidden secrets.\n\nA World Shrouded in Darkness\n\nLong ago, the Great Beast arose from the sea and covered the earth in poison fog. Choking out the land of both life and light, a new era of wonderous misery began.\n\nCenturies have passed. The once hallowed halls and bustling streets are mere shadows. Those deemed undesirable are thrown into the Great Well, a pit of chaos and disease. Cast into its depths for crimes unknown, you awaken in this moonlit subterranean world. Your only hope lies with the sleeping Old One deep below. But many perils lie between you and your ultimate goal.\n\nAn Era Lost to Time\n\nFrom the mind of horror master Akuma Kira, Lunacid harkens to a lost era of first-person ARPGs. Legendary for their meticulous design and dense dungeons, the King’s Field series was the Dark Souls before there was a Dark Souls. Long abandoned by AA/AAA developers, the mantle of “King’s-Like” is left to the humble indie. Which is great, because that's where all the cool weird stuff comes from anyways.\n\nThe world of Lunacid is bursting at the seams with new things to discover, from hidden magics to secret areas. This isn’t just the odd room with a chest in it; entire new areas await those with a watchful eye. Esoteric puzzles and cryptic hints galore are sure to confound and delight even the experienced dungeon delver.\n\nTactile Combat\n\nTake yourself back to a time before dodge rolling. Swipe, backstep, block, and overcome foes with patience and persistence. Featuring a robust body targeting system and unique elemental weaknesses/resistances, each encounter becomes a skilful yet deadly dance of death. Begin your journey as a thief, knight, cleric, or… vampire? Building your character up to you.\n\nAn Arsenal to Uncover\n\nOver 75 weapons await you in the fetid halls of Lunacid. 37 Unique spells, each with applications beyond the obvious. Finding them all, however, is another matter. Unless you use a guide. Which hey, we won’t judge.┐(￣ヮ￣)┌\n\nClassic RPG Challenge\n\nDon’t forget to save.\n\nFeaturing dozens of hours of gameplay and multiple endings, Lunacid is a rich and rewarding take on a classic formula. Relics of past game design long abandoned lie in wait. So jump in the Great Well and let the wonders of Lunacid surprise you. Mimics might just steal your silver instead of eat you.\n\n(ﾉ◕ヮ◕)ﾉ*:･ﾟ✧","aboutGame":null},"vi":{"status":"pending_translation","provider":null,"shortDescription":null,"detailedDescription":null,"aboutGame":null}},"media":{"images":[{"role":"header","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1745510/header.jpg?t=1777045181"},{"role":"capsule","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1745510/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1777045181"}],"screenshots":[{"id":0,"thumbnailUrl":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1745510/ss_2481e2130f4a9145d64f2e5481385b5173fba245.600x338.jpg?t=1777045181","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1745510/ss_2481e2130f4a9145d64f2e5481385b5173fba245.1920x1080.jpg?t=1777045181"},{"id":1,"thumbnailUrl":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1745510/ss_9b06123c6971390c47adcd86588d9596c1fd9423.600x338.jpg?t=1777045181","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1745510/ss_9b06123c6971390c47adcd86588d9596c1fd9423.1920x1080.jpg?t=1777045181"},{"id":2,"thumbnailUrl":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1745510/ss_7148977e25ca77aef9c406398d3dbd72679e93bc.600x338.jpg?t=1777045181","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1745510/ss_7148977e25ca77aef9c406398d3dbd72679e93bc.1920x1080.jpg?t=1777045181"},{"id":3,"thumbnailUrl":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1745510/ss_a3f4e7d0d71728aabfe4a27a62e213286483b56f.600x338.jpg?t=1777045181","url":"ht